      "text": "```\nSYSTEM: ẋ₁ = f₁(x₁, x₂),  ẋ₂ = f₂(x₁, x₂)\nEQUILIBRIUM: f₁(x*) = 0, f₂(x*) = 0"
    },
    {
      "id": "06-NONLINEAR-CONTROL.md#007",
      "path": [
        "06-NONLINEAR-CONTROL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
